{
 "description": "Use before writing or fixing Vega-Lite chart specs for render_diagram (format vegalite): strict-JSON rules, inline data only, valid encoding types, layer/transform/facet examples, identifier rule.",
 "identifier": "Put the identifier in its own data field and use it as the nominal key: `{\"data\":{\"values\":[{\"id\":\"n0002\",\"label\":\"engine\",\"v\":3}]},\"mark\":\"bar\",\"encoding\":{\"x\":{\"field\":\"id\",\"type\":\"nominal\"},\"y\":{\"field\":\"v\",\"type\":\"quantitative\"},\"tooltip\":{\"field\":\"label\",\"type\":\"nominal\"}}}`; show the display name from the `label` field (tooltip or text). Never invent identifiers.",
